Exceptions
----------

The files in original/ started as main.py and vector.py from the public
tutorial repository techwithtim/LocalAIAgentWithRAG, adapted in April 2026 for
this corpus. That repository carries no licence file, so it is all rights
reserved by default and the two adapted files are not covered by this licence.

The guidance text in data/guidance.csv is extracted from the JRC report cited
in README.md and belongs to its publisher.
